                <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle Awesome\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; ACTORS DEFINITION\n&#39; ==========================================\nactor \&quot;Guest User\\n(Người dùng tự do)\&quot; as Guest\nactor \&quot;Candidate\\n(Ứng viên)\&quot; as Candidate\nactor \&quot;Recruiter\\n(Nhà tuyển dụng)\&quot; as Recruiter\nactor \&quot;Admin\\n(Quản trị viên)\&quot; as Admin\n\n&#39; Actor Inheritance\nCandidate --|&gt; Guest\nRecruiter --|&gt; Guest\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; USE CASES DEFINITION\n&#39; ==========================================\nrectangle \&quot;SmartHire Authentication Subsystem\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;UC01: Đăng ký Ứng viên\&quot; as UC_RegCandidate\n    usecase \&quot;UC02: Đăng ký Nhà tuyển dụng\&quot; as UC_RegRecruiter\n    usecase \&quot;UC03: Đăng nhập JWT\&quot; as UC_Login\n    usecase \&quot;UC04: Làm mới Token\\n(Refresh Token)\&quot; as UC_RefreshToken\n    usecase \&quot;UC05: Đăng xuất\&quot; as UC_Logout\n    usecase \&quot;UC06: Quản lý Profile cá nhân\&quot; as UC_ManageProfile\n    usecase \&quot;UC07: Đổi mật khẩu\&quot; as UC_ChangePassword\n    usecase \&quot;UC08: Xác thực &amp; Phân quyền\\n(RBAC Middleware)\&quot; as UC_AuthMiddleware\n}\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; RELATIONSHIPS\n&#39; ==========================================\n\n&#39; Guest Interactions\nGuest --&gt; UC_RegCandidate\nGuest --&gt; UC_RegRecruiter\nGuest --&gt; UC_Login\n\n&#39; Authenticated Users Interactions (Shared)\nCandidate --&gt; UC_ManageProfile\nRecruiter --&gt; UC_ManageProfile\nAdmin --&gt; UC_ManageProfile\n\nCandidate --&gt; UC_ChangePassword\nRecruiter --&gt; UC_ChangePassword\nAdmin --&gt; UC_ChangePassword\n\nCandidate --&gt; UC_Logout\nRecruiter --&gt; UC_Logout\nAdmin --&gt; UC_Logout\n\n&#39; Special Admin Relationship\nAdmin --&gt; UC_Login\n\n&#39; Include &amp; Extend Relationships\nUC_Login .&gt; UC_AuthMiddleware : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_RefreshToken .&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="DkSx-SAHNhIHdGgZZFq4-1">
                    <mxCell style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="1">
